<title>PHILIPPINES: BPI raises prime lending rate to 32 pct.</title>
<headline>BPI raises prime lending rate to 32 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of the Philippine Islands (BPI) said on Tuesday it had raised its prime lending rate to 32 percent from 22 percent last Friday.</p>
<p>Last Wednesday the rate was 19 percent.</p>
<p>The bank said the increase follows stronger central bank rates.</p>
<p>-- Manila Newsroom (63 2) 841 8934</p>
</text>
